<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord to load 31 cargoes in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord to load 31 cargoes in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is scheduled to load 31 cargoes in May, up two from April, traders said.</p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000-barrel shipments.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
